 "hook": "The data this week comes from ScrumQueens by way of Jacquie Tran. Scrumqueen can be found on Twitter @ScrumQueens We write about women's rugby & women in rugby. Volunteers with a passion for equality in our brilliant sport - by @alidonnelly & @johnlbirch. The series, the women's counterpart to the World Rugby Sevens Series, provides elite-level women's competition between rugby nations. As with the men's Sevens World Series, teams compete for the title by accumulating points based on their finishing position in each tournament.",
